# Relational (sql) and document (documentdb) alignment (MEDULLA-DATAPLAT-VOCAB-R008.1).
#
# Each package-local term aligns to its data-platform term so the two cannot
# drift silently: classes `rdfs:subClassOf` (the package term is the emitted
# shape, the dp: term is the engine-side vocabulary), properties
# `owl:equivalentProperty`. Package terms live in the shared
# `http://knuckles.team/kg#` namespace.

@prefix dp: <http://knuckles.team/kg/data-platform#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix : <http://knuckles.team/kg#> .

# --- sql (sql-mcp, database.ttl) ---

:DatabaseSchema rdfs:subClassOf dp:Schema .
:DatabaseTable rdfs:subClassOf dp:Table .
:DatabaseView rdfs:subClassOf dp:View .
:DatabaseColumn rdfs:subClassOf dp:Column .
:hasColumn owl:equivalentProperty dp:hasColumn .
:isPrimaryKey owl:equivalentProperty dp:isPrimaryKey .
:referencesTable owl:equivalentProperty dp:referencesTable .
:sqlDialect owl:equivalentProperty dp:sqlDialect .

# --- documentdb (documentdb-mcp, documentdb.ttl) ---

:Database rdfs:subClassOf dp:Database .
:Collection rdfs:subClassOf dp:Collection .
:documentCount owl:equivalentProperty dp:documentCount .
